  "body": "IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT, CONTACT US RIGHT AWAY!\r\n\r\nWe are offering a 10% cash discount on 5 selected sections (valid for unconditional contracts signed in June only).\r\nWe offer Builder's Terms for up to 9 months.\r\nOur business partner offers Builder's Terms financing of section purchase up to an 80%.\r\nOur business partner offers Construction Loans up to an 80% .\r\n\r\nEnjoying a highly desirable corner position directly opposite a reserve, 11 Hau Tapu Loop presents a 451sqm (approx.) section offering a rare sense of openness, outlook, and long-term appeal. The reserve frontage creates a green, uncluttered aspect that enhances privacy, natural light, and everyday outlook-benefits that are increasingly difficult to secure in established coastal areas. The corner orientation provides added design flexibility, allowing future plans to take advantage of multiple frontages, improved sunlight angles, and a strong connection between indoor and outdoor living. \r\n\r\nPositioned in Stanmore Bay, the location combines lifestyle convenience with future connectivity. Beaches, local shops, schools, and community facilities are all within easy reach, supporting relaxed coastal living. Looking ahead, the upcoming Penlink connection, linking the Whangaparaoa Peninsula directly to SH1, is set to significantly enhance accessibility to Auckland while reinforcing the long-term value of well-positioned sites such as this.\r\n\r\nWhether you're planning a bespoke family home or securing a premium section with enduring outlook and flexibility, this corner reserve-facing site stands apart from standard offerings. Opportunities of this calibre are limited.\r\n\r\nStart the conversation today and see what you could create here.",
